  "description": "@producer, @agent, @distribution and @issuance are recognised by coordinates and members, never by kind. On an ordinary statement about a door, @producer, @issuance or @distribution is invalid (10.2.4); @distribution about a communication at an event context without @issuance is not a later distribution and is invalid; an act may carry @issuance but not @producer or @distribution. A self-description, a later distribution naming @issuance, and an act carrying @issuance are accepted.",
